{"title": "Cosmic Omen of Woe: Attack Roll", "pageid": 48992, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Cosmic_Omen_of_Woe:_Attack_Roll", "categories": ["Reactions", "Class actions", "Patch 8 content"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">See also: <a href=\"/wiki/Cosmic_Omen_of_Weal:_Attack_Roll\" title=\"Cosmic Omen of Weal: Attack Roll\">Cosmic Omen of Weal: Attack Roll</a>        </div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Generic_Wild_Animal.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4f/Generic_Wild_Animal.webp/300px-Generic_Wild_Animal.webp, /w/images/4/4f/Generic_Wild_Animal.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4f/Generic_Wild_Animal.webp/300px-Generic_Wild_Animal.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4f/Generic_Wild_Animal.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Cosmic Omen of Woe: Attack Roll</b> is a reaction granted to <a href=\"/wiki/Circle_of_the_Stars\" title=\"Circle of the Stars\">Circle of the Stars</a> druids that allows them to make incoming attacks miss.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Subtract 1d6 from an <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Roll</a>. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dt> Cost: </dt>\n<dd> <span class=\"bg3wiki-info-blob\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/23px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/35px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/46px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/23px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Reactions\" title=\"Actions\">Reaction</a>&nbsp;+&nbsp;<span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a9/Cosmic_Omen_Resource_Icon.png/20px-Cosmic_Omen_Resource_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a9/Cosmic_Omen_Resource_Icon.png/30px-Cosmic_Omen_Resource_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a9/Cosmic_Omen_Resource_Icon.png/40px-Cosmic_Omen_Resource_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a9/Cosmic_Omen_Resource_Icon.png/20px-Cosmic_Omen_Resource_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/a/a9/Cosmic_Omen_Resource_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Cosmic_Omen_(resource)\" title=\"Cosmic Omen (resource)\">Cosmic Omen</a></span> </dd>         \n</dl>\n\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Other ways to learn:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Granted by using <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cosmic_Omen\" title=\"Cosmic Omen\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/33/Cosmic_Omen_Icon.webp/25px-Cosmic_Omen_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/33/Cosmic_Omen_Icon.webp/38px-Cosmic_Omen_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/33/Cosmic_Omen_Icon.webp/50px-Cosmic_Omen_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cosmic Omen\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/33/Cosmic_Omen_Icon.webp/25px-Cosmic_Omen_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/33/Cosmic_Omen_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Cosmic_Omen\" title=\"Cosmic Omen\">Cosmic Omen</a> during a <a href=\"/wiki/Long_Rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long Rest\">Long Rest</a>.</li></ul>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714220932\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.033 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.035 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1080/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 7933/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2385/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 21/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.006/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 830795/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   27.872      1 -total\n 96.72%   26.958      1 Template:Action_page\